                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9dc6cb2-d7a6-4e44-a656-23a8d8c6795e",
                                "sense_id": "d57d1810-8538-35c5-bbac-c4442bf718c2",
                                "text": "»[…]Wie möchtest du denn genannt werden? Man sagt, glaub ich, heutzutage korrekt Maximalpigmentierter, gell?«\n»Maximalpigmentierter!? Das klingt wie ne Krankheit. Oder Durchfall.« Scheiße, war ich geil in Fahrt. »Verflixt, wir haben hier einen Maximalpigmentierten! Bringt die Kinder ins Haus!«[…]Aber im Ernst. Da ist mir ein Neonazi mit einem gesunden »Drecksneger« fast lieber.",
                                "translation": "“ […] How would you like to be called? I believe the correct form to use these days is ‘maximally pigmented’, right?”\n“Maximally pigmented!? Sounds like an illness. Or diarrhea.” Fuck, I was rolling. “Damn, we have a maximally pigmented here! Bring the children into the house!” […] But seriously, I almost prefer a neo-Nazi with a healthy ‘dirty n***er’.",
                                "english": "“ […] How would you like to be called? I believe the correct form to use these days is ‘maximally pigmented’, right?”\n“Maximally pigmented!? Sounds like an illness. Or diarrhea.” Fuck, I was rolling. “Damn, we have a maximally pigmented here! Bring the children into the house!” […] But seriously, I almost prefer a neo-Nazi with a healthy ‘dirty n***er’."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
